  "content": "<span style=\"margin-left:15px;\"></span>Where a resolution is passed at an adjourned\r\nmeeting of--</br><hr class=\"hr1\"/>\r\n<span style=\"margin-left:15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left:15px;\"></span>\r\n(a) a company; or</br><hr class=\"hr1\"/>\r\n<span style=\"margin-left:15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left:15px;\"></span>\r\n(b) the holders of any class of shares in a company; or</br><hr class=\"hr1\"/>\r\n<span style=\"margin-left:15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left:15px;\"></span>\r\n(c) the Board of Directors of a company,</br><hr class=\"hr1\"/>\r\n<span style=\"margin-left:15px;\"></span>\r\nthe resolution shall, for all purposes, be treated as having been passed on the date on which it was in fact\r\npassed, and shall not be deemed to have been passed on any earlier date.\r\n</br><hr class=\"hr1\"/></br>",
  "footnote": "</br>\t\t",
